&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Marketing Manager, SEO to help shape and grow OpenTable&#39;s organic search presence across 10+ international domains. If you enjoy identifying opportunities, developing strategies and turning insights into measurable impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
