(Senior) Product Manager - Customer Taxation (m/f/d) &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raisin helps customers grow their wealth through savings and investments without barriers. But even the best products and the smoothest experience lose their value if customers pay more tax than they need to, or have to work out, declare and settle their taxes themselves. The Customer Taxation Team makes sure they don’t.&amp;nbsp; We design how tax works in Raisin’s tax-advantaged products, a growing part of our offer. Examples include the new Raisin Cash ISA in the UK and the Raisin Kinderdepot, a children’s investment account that uses the child’s tax allowances automatically. We also calculate and withhold tax on the interest and returns customers earn, handle their tax exemption orders and non-assessment certificates, and provide the annual tax documents they need for their tax return. And we send the tax reports that authorities require.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raisin is available in many European countries, each with its own tax rules and reporting duties. As new regulations come to our platform, we make sure Raisin complies. You will lead a cross-functional team and work closely with Legal, Compliance, Country Management, Product Operations, Customer Service, Data, and external tax and banking partners. Our goal is for customers to trust that their tax is right, find it easy to manage, use the tax allowances they are entitled to, and have peace of mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own a regulated domain that customers depend on every tax year. Working with an experienced Engineering Lead, you will become the go-to expert for customer taxation at Raisin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer taxation end to end: Define the vision and roadmap together with Product and Engineering leadership. Take each topic from discovery to delivery to measured impact. Decide what we build first, and keep stakeholders aligned on priorities, risks and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep tax accurate and reliable: Agree with Legal, Compliance and country managers on what correct looks like. Work with Engineering so calculation, documents and reporting stay stable and easy to extend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow Raisin’s tax proposition: Shape how tax works when Raisin enters new markets, launches tax-advantaged products or brings on new partners. Find where we can take tax work off customers’ hands, so they don’t have to declare and settle it themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex rules into simple experiences: Translate the &amp;nbsp;tax rules behind each launch into clear requirements with the edge cases covered. Design the customer experience and see the work through to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit the deadlines that cannot move: Make sure annual tax documents and statutory reports go out correct and on time, working with Product Operations. Plan backwards from fixed dates and monitor data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catch errors before they reach customers, and escalate early when a date is at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make tax effortless for customers: Keep self-service for tax exemption orders and non-assessment certificates intuitive, so customers get them right the first time. Give Customer Service the tools to answer tax questions fast, especially around tax season.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the team culture: Give and ask for feedback openly, share wins with the team, and treat mistakes as a reason to fix the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Must haves:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of product management experience, including ownership of a technical product such as a back-end, platform or data-heavy service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a cross-functional product team and getting engineers and stakeholders behind shared priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching new products or taking products into new markets, with the precision to get every edge case right, because one wrong tax rule can affect thousands of customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the habit of checking and reconciling numbers yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about tax and a drive to make it feel easy for customers, even when the rules behind it are not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to learn fast, take feedback well and change course when new facts come in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, a strong work ethic and a hands-on attitude to detailed work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured written English, and the confidence to explain trade-offs to senior leaders and say no with a reason.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated field such as banking, payments, insurance or tax technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the tax regime in one or more of Raisin’s markets, for example Germany (Abgeltungsteuer, tax exemption orders), or of statutory reporting such as CRS. Tax knowledge is not required. We will teach you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built tools for operations or customer service teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Important attributes for this role:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bridge product and engineering. You are comfortable discussing data models and architecture trade-offs, and you push for practical solutions that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Product  Berlin, Berlin

Solutions Architect, Pre-Sales - German Defense & Intelligence &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Pre-Sales Solutions Architect, you&#39;ll design complex solutions to demonstrate the value of Planet&#39;s data and services to help organizations within the German Defense and Intelligence community overcome their earth data challenges. You&#39;ll collaborate with internal cross-functional teams, including Customer Success, Product Management, and Business Development, to act as the voice of the customer and enhance Planet&#39;s industry offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates are dedicated to earth observation and enabling customer success across complex technical projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, remote position based in Germany. If located near an office, you are expected to work from that office 3 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver presentations and product demonstrations highlighting technical capabilities of Planet’s platform and our ability to fulfill customer’s business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with customers’ technical and management staff as a trusted advisor to their business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical advisor to the customer to recommend a solutions architecture that fits their business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft the technical response to tenders, RFI’s/RFP’s, and unsolicited proposals with respect to Planet’s products and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with your sales team colleagues to architect and drive the technical strategy across customer and prospect account plans.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal cross-functional teams including Customer Success, Product Management, and Business Development to act as the voice of the customer, assist with RFP and RFI preparation and submissions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attain quarterly and annual sales and operational objectives assigned by management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the needs of Planet&#39;s Defense and Intelligence customers to Sales leadership by communicating forecasts, pipeline opportunities, deal reviews, CRM data, and customer feedback.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present to key executive Government stakeholders within the German Government&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentors junior team members and contributes to team training materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience supporting the German Defense and Intelligence community in a technical capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a relevant field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel, including internationally, up to 25%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in the German language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English, the language of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with GIS and Remote Sensing users within the Defense industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in IMINT, ISR, and related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with QGIS, SocetGXP, ArcGIS, GDAL, Python, and other geospatial software packages and programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and presenting complex systems and solutions that bridge the gap between business problems and technology to meet organizational goals, budget, and scalability needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate and coordinate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to process imagery, manipulate geospatial data, interact with APIs, and build data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obtaining and maintaining eligibility for a German security clearance (Sicherheitsüberprüfung) is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multitask, prioritize, and manage time effectively in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading technical customer engagements and leading workshops or training sessions with users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Planet Labs Germany GmbH is authorized to receive U.S. export-controlled information at Planet under an export license issued by the Bureau of Industry and Security. This position requires access to U.S. and German/EU export-controlled information, and as such, employment (or hiring of a contractor) is contingent upon the candidate’s ability to access all applicable export-controlled information without additional export licensing being required by German, EU, or U.S. authorities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
